---
title: Honeyed Grapefruit Dressing
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{6%Tbsp}
@salt{1/2%tsp}
@grated grapefruit peel{1%tsp}
@honey{6%Tbsp}
@paprika{1%tsp}
@lemon juice{2%Tbsp}
@grapefruit juice{1/4%c}
@salad oil{1%c}

Combine all ingredients, except oil, in a bowl. Add oil in the thin steady stream while beating constantly. Chill thoroughly. Shake before serving.
